M1's transience claim, tested on 584 reachable positions where
a player was below refill_to with a non-empty talon (seeds 0..24)

  deficit later restored to refill_to      569 (97.4%)
  deficit NEVER restored                    15 (2.6%)
  mean unrestored deficit                 2.07 cards

  by talon size at the time of the deficit:
    talon 1-5    n=122    restored  87.7%
    talon 6+     n=462    restored 100.0%

  M1 treats every one of these as transient. Where the deficit
  was never restored, the flatness priced a real, permanent
  difference at zero.
